# Software Architecture

Application Layer
↓
Service Layer
↓
Driver Layer
↓
STM32 HAL

## Driver Layer

- Honeywell Driver
- BMP581 Driver
- MS5611 Driver
- CAN Driver

## Service Layer

- Sensor Manager
- Filters
- Air Data Processing

## Application Layer

- Initialization
- Scheduling
- Runtime Control

## Design Goals

- Modularity
- Maintainability
- Scalability
- Testability
